ers of the guardians in  volume 3. now two characters are a  little up in the air on whether or not  they're going to die and those  characters are drax and mantis now i  know i said i believe drax is going to  die but i believe they might throw a  curveball at us for drax he's either  going to die because he's going to seek  out the final revenge for his family or  there could be some sort of a twist  where his wife and daughter are actually  alive how not sure we need to get a  little bit more information about that  story but this could be a pleasant twist  that they throw at us if they throw this  at us there is still the possibility  that drax could die to save his family  or there's the possibility that he could  get his happily ever after dave bautista  did say it's his last film but james  gunn just said that this is the end of  the franchise so it's kind of  everybody's last film i probably am  leaning more towards he'll die but maybe  he'll get his happy ending and mantis  i'm really unsure about because there  isn't necessarily a big reason for her  to die besides helping her family and  protecting the guardians which could  very well happen but i just kind of feel  like she's one of the characters that  will just live now groot like i said can  kind of go either way because he almost  can't die yes he can fully die but i  don't think he will in the mcu so it's  kind of irrelevant because he could just  sacrifice himself like he did in the  first one and come back but it really  comes down to peter and gamora now  gamora isn't the same gamora that we've  known all this time but i don't think  she's going to die because adam  warlock's coming in this movie and they  have a big relationship in the comics  and i don't think adam warlock is just  showing up for one movie i think he's  here for a long time in the mcu so i  think they might explore that and gamora  might be sticking around now as far as  star-lord is concerned he could die it  is a possibility 